.mdx","Instala con Helm","Prepara las dependencias, configura el chart de Lamassu y verifica un despliegue controlado en Kubernetes.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-64/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm",{"_65":383},"deployment/self-hosted/helm.mdx",{"_40":385,"_47":58,"_42":386,"_52":387,"_61":-7,"_12":388,"_63":389},"es:deployment/self-hosted/networking.mdx","Expón el Gateway","Elige cómo llegan los clientes a Lamassu, cuándo definir gateway.addresses y cómo diseñar varios Gateways.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-64/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking",{"_65":390},"deployment/self-hosted/networking.mdx",{"_40":392,"_47":58,"_42":393,"_52":394,"_61":-7,"_12":395,"_63":396},"es:deployment/self-hosted/fastlane.mdx","Fastlane","Arranca un entorno completo de evaluación o laboratorio de Lamassu en un clúster Kubernetes existente.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-64/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane",{"_65":397},"deployment/self-hosted/fastlane.mdx",{"_40":399,"_47":86,"_61":-7,"_42":400},"es:_8","Operación",{"_40":402,"_47":58,"_42":403,"_52":404,"_61":-7,"_12":405,"_63":406},"es:deployment/troubleshooting.mdx","Resolución de problemas de despliegue","Diagnostica acceso, salud de los servicios y dependencias de infraestructura.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-64/es/deployment/troubleshooting",{"_65":407},"deployment/troubleshooting.mdx",{"_40":409,"_47":86,"_61":-7,"_42":410},"es:_9","Otros modelos",{"_40":412,"_47":58,"_42":413,"_52":414,"_61":-7,"_12":415,"_63":416},"es:deployment/aws-marketplace.mdx","Despliega desde AWS Marketplace","Ejecuta una instancia preconfigurada de Lamassu IoT en Amazon EC2.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-64/es/deployment/aws-marketplace",{"_65":417},"deployment/aws-marketplace.mdx",{"_40":419,"_47":58,"_42":420,"_52":421,"_61":-7,"_12":422,"_63":423},"es:deployment/saas.mdx","Utiliza Lamassu como SaaS","Consume Lamassu como servicio gestionado sin operar infraestructura propia.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-64/es/deployment/saas",{"_65":424},"deployment/saas.mdx","es:deployment",{"_198":427},"depl